cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  DeMeyer_etal_2026_Extreme_Cyclones: analysis code for
  extratropical-cyclone-associated precipitation and near-surface
  wind extremes over North America
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself
  and the associated journal article.
type: software
abstract: >-
  Python analysis code accumulating precipitation and near-surface
  wind exceedances above the 99th all-hour percentile within 1000 km
  of extratropical cyclone centres over North America, decomposed
  into exceedance frequency and mean intensity. Applied to hourly
  ERA5 and CRCM6-GEM5 output over a 35-year period.

authors:
  # TODO: verify the spelling of your family name ("De Meyer" vs "DeMeyer")
  #       and add your ORCID; add every co-author, in manuscript order.
  - family-names: "De Meyer"
    given-names: "Victorien"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6566-2716"
    affiliation: >-
      Centre pour l'Étude et la Simulation du Climat à l'Échelle Régionale
      (ESCER), Université du Québec à Montréal, Montréal, Québec, Canada
