preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "FUTURE PROJECTIONS OF EXTREME WIND AND PRECIPITATION ASSOCIATED WITH EXTRATROPICAL CYCLONES OVER NORTH AMERICA USING REGIONAL CLIMATE SIMULATIONS"
  authors:
